      <div class="sw"><div style="background:#1B2F4B"></div><p>Navy text #1B2F4B (chữ, 13:1)</p></div>
      <div class="sw"><div style="background:#FBFAF7;border-bottom:1px solid #eee"></div><p>Cream #FBFAF7 (nền)</p></div>
      <div class="sw"><div style="background:#2E7D4F"></div><p>Bamboo green #2E7D4F (nút phụ, icon, "đang mở"; chữ trắng 5.1:1)</p></div>
    </div>
    <h3 style="margin-top:1.5rem">Nút</h3>
    <div class="row"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#">Mặc định</a><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#" style="background:#F2B400;transform:translateY(-1px)">Hover</a><a class="btn btn-primary focus-demo" href="#">Focus (bàn phím)</a><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#" style="background:#CC9500">Active</a><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#" aria-disabled="true">Đã đóng ghi danh</a></div>
    <div class="row"><a class="btn btn-dark" href="#">Phụ (xanh tre)</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="#">Viền</a><a class="btn btn-outline focus-demo" href="#">Viền · focus</a></div>
